CST-DUST finite AA even-parity mixing control v0.1
X6 spectral astrolabium research programme, 11 November 2026.
Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

This work extends the declared finite action, boundary-state and Abel-existence
contracts from thomasmgfeller/x6-spectral-astrolabium, PR #279 through #281.
Frozen input files and Git blob identifiers are recorded in provenance.json.
Python-FLINT/Arb performs the enclosure arithmetic; NumPy is used only for an
independent floating-point implementation cross-check.
No physical CST transition matrix, probability or bounce theorem is claimed.
